CHAPTER.VERS:
and David said to the Gibeonites, What shall I do for you

          {+}
        ? And how shall I make atonement, that you

          {+}
         may bless the inheritance of Yahweh?

And the Gibeonites said to him, It is no matter of silver or gold between us and Saul, or his house; neither is it for us to put any man to death in Israel. And he said, What you

          {+}
         will say, that I will do for you

          {+}
        .
